{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27606","headline":"爱妾换马 一 · 张祜","name":"爱妾换马 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一面妖桃千里蹄，娇姿骏骨价应齐。\n乍牵玉勒辞金栈，催整花钿出绣闺。\n去日岂无沾袂泣，归时还有顿衔嘶。\n婵娟躞蹀春风里，挥手摇鞭杨柳堤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}